    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-z-and-schemas",
        "moduleId": "z-and-schema",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材导读：Z 与 schema",
        "markdown": "Z 是以集合论描述数据和操作的规格说明语言。教材指出，schema 是 Z 特有的组织单位：它像记录结构一样，把命名字段、字段间必须成立的关系以及涉及字段的动作放在一起描述。\n\n一个操作可以由多个 schema 组成——正常情形一个，异常情形另设；schema 可以逐个引入。Z 与 VDM 都采用 model-oriented 方法，用集合论模型描述系统；这样的规格像“用集合论写的实现”，并不是可执行程序。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-2af98d1121e7e235ed121771",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000034"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Introduction to the Z Specification Language"
              ],
              "lineStart": 402,
              "lineEnd": 413,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "abc6949f4b217b6e3bcb27ab0104b830c02318ccac8340e45fe8f8030e9dd47d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-schema-reading",
        "moduleId": "z-and-schema",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "先看符号，再看 schema",
        "markdown": "可以把 schema 想成一张带约束的表格：一边列出状态或操作的组成部分，另一边写明这些部分必须满足的条件。读规格时先不必关心它最终用数组、链表还是树实现；符号首先固定的是“允许哪些值、哪些关系必须成立”。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-z-and-schemas"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-set-symbols",
        "moduleId": "set-notation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "集合与幂集符号",
        "markdown": "教材的基本集合符号包括：$\\mathcal{P}X$ 表示 $X$ 的所有子集组成的集合；$x \\in A$ 表示 $x$ 是 $A$ 的元素，$x \\notin A$ 是其否定；$A \\subseteq B$ 表示 $A$ 是 $B$ 的子集；$A \\cup B$ 表示并集。\n\n这些符号只规定集合层面的关系，不规定程序中的存储方式。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-2af98d1121e7e235ed121771",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Introduction to the Z Specification Language",
                "Some Z Notation"
              ],
              "lineStart": 414,
              "lineEnd": 430,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "b91c525a417bd89c4adeaf50661077c856b1fc69d1fe7ebda2b51159fbe78970"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-set-reading",
        "moduleId": "set-notation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "读一个集合式子",
        "markdown": "若 $NAME$ 是所有姓名的集合，则 $\\mathcal{P}NAME$ 是由任意一组姓名组成的集合。规格写 $known \\subseteq NAME$，表示当前记录的姓名集合只能从 $NAME$ 中取元素。注意 $\\in$ 描述元素与集合，$\\subseteq$ 描述集合与集合，二者不能互换。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-set-symbols"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-function-types",
        "moduleId": "function-notation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "偏函数、全函数与定义域",
        "markdown": "教材用 $f: A \\rightharpoonup B$ 表示偏函数，用 $f: A \\to B$ 表示全函数。全函数把 $A$ 的每个元素都映射到 $B$；偏函数允许某些 $A$ 中元素没有对应值。$\\mathrm{dom}\\,f$ 表示定义域。\n\n对全函数有 $\\mathrm{dom}\\,f = A$；对偏函数，$x \\in \\mathrm{dom}\\,f$ 当且仅当 $f(x)$ 有定义。教材说明表格适合用偏函数表示，因为不预期每个可能输入都已有输出。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-2af98d1121e7e235ed121771",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Introduction to the Z Specification Language",
                "Some Z Notation"
              ],
              "lineStart": 414,
              "lineEnd": 430,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "b91c525a417bd89c4adeaf50661077c856b1fc69d1fe7ebda2b51159fbe78970"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-table-domain",
        "moduleId": "function-notation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "把表格读成偏函数",
        "markdown": "“姓名到生日”的表格可看成偏函数 $birthday: NAME \\rightharpoonup DATE$：表里出现的姓名属于定义域，能查到日期；没有登记的姓名不在定义域内，查询无定义。写成全函数会错误地承诺每个姓名都有记录。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-function-types"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-function-update",
        "moduleId": "function-update",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "扩展与覆盖",
        "markdown": "函数可看成一组成员有序对。教材用 $f \\cup \\{x \\mapsto y\\}$ 表示把 $f$ 扩展为同时把 $x$ 映射到 $y$ 的函数；$\\{x \\mapsto y\\}$ 是只含一个映射的平凡函数。\n\n更一般地，$f \\oplus g$ 在定义域相交处用 $g$ 覆盖 $f$。只要 $f$ 和 $g$ 都是函数，$f \\oplus g$ 仍是函数；而 $f \\cup g$ 只有在交集上取值一致时才是函数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-2af98d1121e7e235ed121771",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Introduction to the Z Specification Language",
                "Some Z Notation"
              ],
              "lineStart": 414,
              "lineEnd": 430,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "b91c525a417bd89c4adeaf50661077c856b1fc69d1fe7ebda2b51159fbe78970"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-birthday-update",
        "moduleId": "function-update",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "更新一条生日记录",
        "markdown": "设 $birthday = \\{Alice \\mapsto 1\\text{ Jan}\\}$。登记 Bob 的生日可写 $birthday \\cup \\{Bob \\mapsto 2\\text{ Feb}\\}$；若 Bob 已在定义域中，则用 $birthday \\oplus \\{Bob \\mapsto 2\\text{ Feb}\\}$ 覆盖旧值。前者扩充记录，后者明确表示以新值替换旧值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-function-update",
            "textbook-function-types"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-reading-check",
        "moduleId": "reading-check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "检查：逐符号读规格",
        "markdown": "读规格片段时依次检查：变量声明中的类型（如 $\\mathcal{P}NAME$ 或 $NAME \\rightharpoonup DATE$）；不变式中的集合或函数关系（如 $known = \\mathrm{dom}\\,birthday$）；操作使用的是扩展 $\\cup$ 还是覆盖 $\\oplus$；前置条件在什么情况下成立。\n\n练习：若 $f: NAME \\rightharpoonup DATE$，能否说“每个姓名都能查到日期”？不能——偏函数只保证定义域内元素有值，定义域外的姓名没有定义。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-set-symbols",
            "textbook-function-types",
            "textbook-function-update"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
